The Drama 3 model execution in src/drama3/model.py adapts the Fish Speech Drama 3
architecture to persistent request slots, independent scheduling, packed
projections and FlashInfer operators. The model loader, tokenizer, prompt
construction, codec and reference sampler are imported from Fish Speech.
The upstream source itself is not modified. Its license is included in
third_party_licenses/Fish-Audio-Community-License.txt.

FlashInfer and PyTorch provide GPU operators. The Gated DeltaNet implementation
is imported from SGLang's FLA kernel modules; SGLang's engine, scheduler and
Omni serving pipeline are not used by the candidate runtime. Their respective
licenses remain applicable to those dependencies.

The offline accuracy script imports Seed-TTS WER and speaker-verification
implementations from the pinned SGLang-Omni benchmark repository (Apache-2.0).
Model weights and evaluation audio are downloaded separately and are not
included in this repository.
